===Etymology 1===
From , {{m|enm|minute}}, {{m|enm|mynet}}, from , from . {{doublet|en|menu|menudo}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{enPR|mĭn'ĭt}}, {{IPA|en|/ˈmɪnɪt/}}
* {{audio|en|en-uk-a minute.ogg|Audio (UK)}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-minute-noun.ogg|Audio (US)}}
